# Overview

This repository documents my work in designing autonomous systems across:

* Trading infrastructure
* Backend engineering
* Embedded systems
* Runtime orchestration
* Decision engines

My work focuses on building software that remains deterministic under uncertainty while minimizing operational complexity.

Core engineering themes include:

* autonomous execution
* explainable decisions
* runtime isolation
* failure recovery
* deterministic state management
* infrastructure simplicity

> Observe → Decide → Act

